&Q000458 = An adab to Enlil for Išme-Dagan (Išme-Dagan H)
@composite
#project: etcslatf/inter
#atf: use unicode
#atf: use math
#etcsl: text-id=c.2.5.4.08
#key: after http://etcsl.orinst.ox.ac.uk/cgi-bin/etcsl.cgi?text=c.2.5.4.08&display=Crit&charenc=gcirc#

@div sa-gida A

A.1. [...] X IM u₅ nun diŋir-re-e-ne [...] me šar₂-ra-ba dur₂ ŋar
#lem: X; X; X; u[ride]; nun[prince]; diŋir[deity]; X; me[Being]; šar[numerous]V/i; dur[buttocks]; ŋar[put]
#tr.en: …… the prince of gods …… seated upon all the divine powers, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.1

A.2. {[d]}[nu-nam]-nir en a₂ aŋ₂-ŋa₂ zid-da me gal-gal-la šu du₇
#lem: Nunamnir[1]DN; en[lord]; a[arm]; aŋ[measure]; zid[right]; me[Being]; gal[big]; šu[hand]; du[perfect]
#tr.en: @wDN{Nunamnir}, the lord of just decrees, who possesses fully the great divine powers, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.2

A.3. [a]-a# {d}en-lil₂ ni₂-zu an ki-a pa e₃ ša-ba-ni-e₃
#lem: aya[father]; Enlil[1]DN; ni[fear]; an[sky]; ki[place]; pa[branch]; e[leave]; e[leave]
#tr.en: Father @wDN{Enlil}, made your fearsomeness manifest in heaven and on the earth. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.3

A.4. diŋir an-na an-na bi₂-su₈-ug mu dug₃ im-mi-in-sa₄
#lem: diŋir[deity]; an[sky]; an[sky]; sug[stand]; mu[name]; dug[good]; še[call by name]
#tr.en: He made the gods of heaven stand by in heaven (?), and gave them (?) auspicious names. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.4

A.5. [...] X KA X lugal-ba igi mu-ni-si-si
#lem: X; X; X; X; lugal[king]; igi[eye]; si[fill]
#tr.en: …… its king ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.5

A.6. [...]-bi NE X ZU
#lem: X; X; X; X
#tr.en: The @wDN{Anuna}, its great gods, line up before you. @wDN{Enlil}, they pay attention to your holy words and august statements. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.6

A.7. {d}a-nun-na# diŋir gal-gal-bi igi-zu-uš si mu-sa₂#-e-eš
#lem: Anunak[1]DN; diŋir[deity]; gal[big]; igi[eye]; si[horn]; sa[equal]
#tr.en: @wDN{Nunamnir}, you alone are elevated in the entirety of heaven and earth. …… of the @wDN{Anuna} gods, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.7

A.8. {[d]}en#-lil₂ inim kug dug₄-ga mah-zu-še₃ ŋizzal im-ši-ma-an-ak-eš
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; inim[word]; kug[purify]; dug[speak]; mah[great]; ŋizzal[hearing]; ak[do]
#tr.en: august shackle on all the lands, your …… is unfathomable. Everything this lord has is surpassing, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.8

A.9. {[d]}[nu-nam]-nir# an ki niŋin₂-na-bi dili-zu-ni mah-me-en
#lem: Nunamnir[1]DN; an[sky]; ki[place]; niŋin[encircle]; dili[single]; mah[great]
#tr.en: and his orders are not to be changed. …… your divine powers surpass all others, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.9

A.10. [...] X {d}a-nun-na-ke₄-ne {ŋiš}rab₃ mah kur-kur-ra
#lem: X; X; Anunak[1]DN; raba[clamp]; mah[great]; kur[mountain(s)]
#tr.en: your ways are ingenious, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.10

A.11. [...]-zu su₃-ud en niŋ₂-nam-ma-ni dib dug₄-ga-ni nu-kam₃-me-dam
#lem: X; sud[distant]; en[lord]; niŋnam[anything]; dib[pass]; dug[speak]; kam[alter]
#tr.en: …… you are the trustworthy shepherd even of far-away foreign countries. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.11

A.12. [...] gal-la-a me-zu me-a dirig a-ra₂-zu niŋ₂ galam-ma-am₃ X nam-kal kur ki su₃-ra₂-še₃ sipad zid-bi# za#-e#-me-en
#lem: X; gal[big]; me[Being]; me[Being]; dirig[make more than]; ara[way]; niŋ[thing]; galam[skilful]; X; namkala[value]; kur[mountain(s)]; ki[place]; sud[distant]; sipad[shepherd]; zid[right]; zaʾe[you]
#tr.en: Father @wDN{Enlil}, your beloved …… @wTN{E-kur}, has been built in @wTN{Ki-ur}, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.12

A.13. a-[a] {d}en-lil₂ ki-ur₃ dur-an-ki šag₄-ge pad₃-da-za
#lem: aya[father]; Enlil[1]DN; Kiʾur[1]; Durankik[1]TN; šag[heart]; pad[find]
#tr.en: in @wTN{Dur-an-ki}, the place chosen by you; your august dais has been set up there. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.13

A.14. ZU X e₂-kur ki aŋ₂-zu šu-mu-ra-an-du₃ barag mah-zu šu-mu-un-ri
#lem: X; X; Ekur[1]TN; ki[place]; aŋ[measure]; du[build]; barag[sanctum]; mah[great]; ri[impose]
#tr.en: The divine powers of your shrine are precious, its true purification rites are august, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.14

A.15. eš₃-za me-bi me kal-kal-a-am₃ šu-luh zid-bi mah-am₃
#lem: eš[shrine]; me[Being]; me[Being]; kal[rare]; šuluh[ritual cleansing]; zid[right]; mah[great]
#tr.en: and its cultic ordinances are pure and ineffable. The interior of E-kur is artfully fashioned, 
#etcsl: line-id=A.15

A.16. ŋarza-bi kug-kug-ga-am₃ niŋ₂ ka-ge dib-ba-am₃
#lem: ŋarza[rites]; kug[pure]; niŋ[thing]; kag[mouth]; dib[pass]
#tr.en: and no one may come to know it. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.16

A.17. e₂-kur-ra šag₄-bi galam# kad₄#-am₃ niŋ₂ lu₂ nu-zu-am₃
#lem: Ekur[1]TN; šag[heart]; galam[skilful]; kad[tie]; niŋ[thing]; lu[person]; zu[know]
#tr.en: Let @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}} care properly for its true divine plans and powers! 
#etcsl: line-id=A.17

A.18. {d}iš-me-{d}da-gan ŋiš-hur me zid-bi si ha-ra-ab-sa₂-sa₂-e
#lem: Išmedagan[1]RN; ŋešhur[plan]; me[Being]; zid[right]; si[horn]; sa[equal]
#etcsl: line-id=A.18

@div trailer 

A.19. sa-gid₂-da-am₃
#lem: sagida[musical notation]
#tr.en: @fsux{Sa-gida}. 
#etcsl: line-id=A.19

@end trailer

@end sa-gida

@div ŋišgiŋal B

B.20. {d}en-lil₂ {d}iš-me-{d}da-gan dumu ki aŋ₂-za nam-lugal-la-a-na bal-bi ha-ra-su₃-ud#
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; Išmedagan[1]RN; dumu[child]; ki[place]; aŋ[measure]; namlugal[kingship]; bala[turn]; sud[distant]
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil}, through you may the term of kingship of @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}}, your beloved son, be enduring! 
#etcsl: line-id=B.20

@div trailer 

B.21. ŋiš-gi₄-ŋal₂ sa-gid₂-da-bi-im
#lem: ŋešgiŋal[musical refrain]; sagida[musical notation]
#tr.en: @fsux{Ŋišgiŋal} of the @fsux{sa-gida}. 
#etcsl: line-id=B.21

@end trailer

@end ŋišgiŋal

@div sa-ŋara C

C.22. {d}en-lil₂ en gal diŋir-re-e-ne uŋ₃ šar₂-ra-bi-še₃ il₂-la
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; en[lord]; gal[big]; diŋir[deity]; uŋ[people]; šar[numerous]V/i; il[raise]
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil}, great lord of the gods, elevated above the numerous people! 
#etcsl: line-id=C.22

C.23. [...] en gal diŋir-re-e-ne uŋ₃# šar₂-ra-bi-še₃ il₂-la
#lem: X; en[lord]; gal[big]; diŋir[deity]; uŋ[people]; šar[numerous]V/i; il[raise]
#tr.en: ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=C.23

C.24. [...] inim# mah dug₄-ga-zu X saŋ#-ba du-am₃
#lem: X; inim[word]; mah[great]; dug[speak]; X; saŋ[head]; ŋen[go]
#tr.en: great lord of the gods, elevated above the numerous people! 
#etcsl: line-id=C.24

C.25. [...] niŋ₂ nu-kur₂-ru dug₄-ga-zu ki-bi-še₃ ŋar
#lem: X; niŋ[thing]; kur[different]; dug[speak]; ki[place]; ŋar[put]
#tr.en: …… your august utterances are prominent. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.25

C.26. [...] X tuku saŋ us₂ e₂-za-ra
#lem: X; X; tuku[acquire]; saŋ[head]; us[accompany]; e[house]
#tr.en: …… cannot be countermanded, your statements are firm. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.26

C.27. [...] UN#-še₃ nam dug₃ tar-mu-ni-ib
#lem: X; X; nam[fate]; dug[good]; tar[cut]
#tr.en: Decide a good fate …… for the constant attendant of your temple ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.27

C.28. {[d]}[iš-me]-{[d]}[da-gan] dumu {d}en-lil₂-la₂-ka [...] RI
#lem: Išmedagan[1]RN; dumu[child]; Enlil[1]DN; X; X
#tr.en: …… @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}}, the son of @wDN{Enlil}, ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.28

C.29. [... an] ki zag til-be₂-eš [... he₂]-em-mah
#lem: X; an[sky]; ki[place]; zag[side]; til[complete]; X; mah[great]
#tr.en: May …… to the uttermost limits of heaven and earth …… exalted. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.29

C.30. [...] X-bi he₂-bad-bad
#lem: X; X; bad[open]
#tr.en: May …… submit ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.30

C.31. [...] ki kur he₂-em-ši-gam-e
#lem: X; ki[place]; kur[mountain(s)]; gurum[bend]
#tr.en: May you …… @wRN{Išme-@wDN{Dagan}} ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.31

C.32. [...] {[d]}[iš-me]-{d}da-gan [... he₂]-me-en
#lem: X; Išmedagan[1]RN; X; me[be]
#tr.en: May …… be bestowed on you ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.32

C.33. [...] X he₂-me-en
#lem: X; X; me[be]
#tr.en: May you …… indefatigable ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.33

C.34. [...]-sub₂-ba
#lem: ŋen[go]
#tr.en: …… holy place, pure place ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.34

C.35. [...] he₂#-me-en
#lem: X; me[be]
#etcsl: line-id=C.35

C.36. [...] he₂-en-ŋal₂
#lem: X; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]
#etcsl: line-id=C.36

C.37. [...] ZI# he₂-ši-mah
#lem: X; X; mah[great]
#etcsl: line-id=C.37

C.38. [...] saŋ-e-eš he₂-rig₇
#lem: X; saŋ[head]; rig[donate]
#etcsl: line-id=C.38

C.39. [... ŋa₂-la] nu-dag#-ge he₂-me-en
#lem: X; ŋala[cvne]; dag[roam around]; me[be]
#etcsl: line-id=C.39

C.40. [...] X ki kug ki sikil X [...] im-mi-ib₂-ŋal₂
#lem: X; X; ki[place]; kug[purify]; ki[place]; sikil[purify]; X; X; ŋal[⟦be⟧ to be (there]
#etcsl: line-id=C.40

@div trailer 

C.41. [sa-ŋar-ra]-am₃
#lem: saŋara[musical notation]
#tr.en: @fsux{Sa-ŋara}. 
#etcsl: line-id=C.41

@end trailer

@end sa-ŋara

@div uru D

D.42. [...] {[d]}a-nun-na-ke₄-ne
#lem: X; Anunak[1]DN
#tr.en: …… the @wDN{Anuna} gods ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=D.42

D.43. [...] {d}a-nun-na-ke₄-ne
#lem: X; Anunak[1]DN
#tr.en: …… the @wDN{Anuna} gods ……. 
#etcsl: line-id=D.43

D.44. [...] X X X bal dug₃ mu nam-he₂
#lem: X; X; X; X; bala[turn]; dug[good]; mu[year]; namhe[abundance]
#tr.en: ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=D.44

D.45. [... saŋ-e-eš] rig₇#-mu-ni-ib₂
#lem: X; saŋ[head]; rig[donate]
#tr.en: bestow on him …… a good reign, and prosperous years. 
#etcsl: line-id=D.45

@div trailer 

D.46. [u₁₈-ru₁₂-bi]-im
#lem: uru[literary subscript]
#tr.en: Its @fsux{uru} (?). 
#etcsl: line-id=D.46

@end trailer

@end uru

@div trailer 

D.47. [a-da-ab] {d}en-[lil₂]-la₂#-kam
#lem: adab[drum]; Enlil[1]DN
#tr.en: An @fsux{adab} (?) of @wDN{Enlil}. 
#etcsl: line-id=D.47

